('advanced-native-1613', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1613-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["桌子滿足這次分類材料的實際用途。"],"options":["沒有裝飾表示它不能提供任何工作面。","小組已停止每周聚會，目前只把桌子作展示。","桌子滿足這次分類材料的實際用途。","桌子被形容為每種活動中外觀最華麗的選擇。"]},"advanced-native-1613-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["Its simple design still meets the practical need.","We can use it comfortably for the task we planned.","Decorative features are not necessary for this particular use.","It does the job by giving us the surface we need for sorting."],"options":["Its simple design still meets the practical need.","We can use it comfortably for the task we planned.","Decorative features are not necessary for this particular use.","It does the job by giving us the surface we need for sorting."]},"advanced-native-1613-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The basic recorder does the job for capturing the interview clearly."],"options":["The basic recorder does the job for capturing the interview clearly.","Without advanced editing features, it cannot meet any recording need.","A clear interview recording proves it is the best device for every media project."]},"advanced-native-1613-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["已證明它在所有情境都是最佳選擇。"],"options":["已證明它在所有情境都是最佳選擇。","仍需說清要完成哪項實際工作。","在指定用途上足夠合用。"]},"advanced-native-1613-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["Yes, it does the job if it meets the intended need; the phrase does not require it to be the most elaborate option."],"options":["Ignore the task and judge usefulness only by how impressive the equipment looks.","Yes, it does the job if it meets the intended need; the phrase does not require it to be the most elaborate option.","Use the phrase only for the option with the longest list of extra features."]},"advanced-native-1613-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["The shared sheet does the job for our one-day loan record because it shows who has each item and whether it has been returned.","A simple sheet does the job for these basic records; that does not mean it