('advanced-native-1614', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1614-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["中心空間有限或需求高，需要安排共享。"],"options":["中心有很多閒置房間，完全沒有使用競爭。","句子已列出每個房間的確切租金。","小組只因喜歡同一種裝飾而協調，空間並無限制。","中心空間有限或需求高，需要安排共享。"]},"advanced-native-1614-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["They want to avoid one group occupying space another group needs.","Careful timing makes the available rooms more useful to everyone.","Space is at a premium, so they need to share what is available.","Several groups need the same limited facilities."],"options":["They want to avoid one group occupying space another group needs.","Careful timing makes the available rooms more useful to everyone.","Space is at a premium, so they need to share what is available.","Several groups need the same limited facilities."]},"advanced-native-1614-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Space is at a premium in the archive."],"options":["Space is at a premium in the archive.","The archive has no competing use for its many empty cabinets.","The statement gives the exact price charged for each shelf."]},"advanced-native-1614-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["每個使用者實際要支付的確切金額。"],"options":["每個使用者實際要支付的確切金額。","不同用途可能需競爭或共享空間。","可用位置可能有限。"]},"advanced-native-1614-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["Space is at a premium, but movement and access are uses of space too; we should compare the actual needs."],"options":["Space is at a premium, but movement and access are uses of space too; we should compare the actual needs.","Use only the amount of shelving as the measure and leave access out of the plan.","Treat any area people move through as available storage before asking how they use it."]},"advanced-native-1614-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Space is at a premium on our noticeboard, so we should remove expired posters and keep current dates and contacts easy to read.","Because space is at a premium, a regular update could give useful current information priority over notices for events that have already ended."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1615', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1615-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["外觀悅目與資料準確仍是兩個需分開看的問題。"],"options":["外觀悅目與資料準確仍是兩個需分開看的問題。","配色悅目就已核實了活動日期及地點。","海報文字已通過讀者易讀性測試，不只是外觀獲評價。","海報看起來凌亂，說話者完全不喜歡外觀。"]},"advanced-native-1615-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["I found the overall look calm and appealing.","It was easy on the eye, with restrained colours and a clear visual layout.","The colours worked pleasantly together.","The page did not feel visually crowded."],"options":["I found the overall look calm and appealing.","It was easy on the eye, with restrained colours and a clear visual layout.","The colours worked pleasantly together.","The page did not feel visually crowded."]},"advanced-native-1615-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The page is easy on the eye, but the navigation still needs work."],"options":["Difficulty finding a button proves that the colours could not look pleasant.","The page is easy on the eye, but the navigation still needs work.","A pleasant appearance confirms that every visitor can complete the registration route."]},"advanced-native-1615-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["內容及實際使用方法已經核實合適。"],"options":["外觀令人舒服、悅目。","內容及實際使用方法已經核實合適。","不同人仍可能對外觀有不同感受。"]},"advanced-native-1615-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["It may be easy on the eye, but we should still test whether people can find and use the registration steps."],"options":["It may be easy on the eye, but we should still test whether people can find and use the registration steps.","Use the pleasant colours as a substitute for checking the buttons.","If the registration route is confusing, there is no reason to consider its appearance pleasant."]},"advanced-native-1615-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["The cover is easy on the eye with its soft colours, but I would read the notes or hear a sample before describing the music.","I find the cover easy on the eye, though the attractive image does not tell me what the songs sound like. Let us listen to a short sample."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1616', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1616-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["安排按工作需要有效使用有限位置。"],"options":["小組擴大了房間，而沒有改變工作位置的使用方式。","安排按工作需要有效使用有限位置。","小組只按物品數量塞滿房間，不看工作怎樣進行。","小組為各種工作保留不共用的獨立工作面。"]},"advanced-native-1616-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["They wanted to make the most of limited space for the tasks they actually do.","The arrangement let several tasks use the available area more effectively.","Sharing a surface avoided reserving a separate area for every task.","They planned around practical use instead of simply adding more items."],"options":["They wanted to make the most of limited space for the tasks they actually do.","The arrangement let several tasks use the available area more effectively.","Sharing a surface avoided reserving a separate area for every task.","They planned around practical use instead of simply adding more items."]},"advanced-native-1616-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["They want to make the most of limited space while keeping the display usable."],"options":["They want to make the most of limited space while keeping the display usable.","They measure success only by the number of objects, regardless of whether visitors can read them.","They kept the display on one level and planned to let visitors see different sections at separate times."]},"advanced-native-1616-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["物品增加了很多，但無法說明人怎樣操作及取用。"],"options":["有合適收納，也有日常工作所需的位置。","物品增加了很多，但無法說明人怎樣操作及取用。","可清楚說明共用安排如何支援實際活動。"]},"advanced-native-1616-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["To make the most of limited space, we should check how people reach and use the items, not only how many shelves fit."],"options":["Assume a larger number of shelves is enough evidence that the tasks will work better.","To make the most of limited space, we should check how people reach and use the items, not only how many shelves fit.","Count the shelves first and leave all questions about use until the room is full."]},"advanced-native-1616-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["We can make the most of limited space by using the same table for storytelling, crafts and sharing at different times, with a short changeover between sessions.","A shared timetable would help us make the most of limited space without keeping three separate sets of equipment idle throughout the event."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1617', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1617-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["摺床解決臨時留宿的實際需要。"],"options":["家人原已替這位客人安排好固定房間，摺床沒有用到。","摺床令主人需要重排每個房間，未減少臨時工作。","摺床解決臨時留宿的實際需要。","摺床使客人更難找到休息位置。"]},"advanced-native-1617-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["It gave our guest somewhere usable to rest at short notice.","We could respond to the extra guest without rearranging every room.","It made an awkward last-minute situation much easier to handle.","It was a bit of a lifesaver for the overnight arrangement."],"options":["It gave our guest somewhere usable to rest at short notice.","We could respond to the extra guest without rearranging every room.","It made an awkward last-minute situation much easier to handle.","It was a bit of a lifesaver for the overnight arrangement."]},"advanced-native-1617-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The borrowed charger was a lifesaver before the presentation."],"options":["The charger’s help means the content of the presentation no longer needs checking.","The borrowed charger was a lifesaver before the presentation.","The charger had no role in helping me continue the preparation."]},"advanced-native-1617-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["只有真的避免死亡才可在日常說這片語。"],"options":["只有真的避免死亡才可在日常說這片語。","應按具體情況說明它幫了哪方面。","某項幫助讓困難情況較容易處理。"]},"advanced-native-1617-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["I am glad it was a lifesaver for checking the session times; we can still confirm any last-minute changes with the desk."],"options":["I would set the printout aside and wait for the network before making any session plan.","I am glad it was a lifesaver for checking the session times; we can still confirm any last-minute changes with the desk.","Treat the old printout as enough reason not to check any changes announced today."]},"advanced-native-1617-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Your help with the volunteers’ questions was a lifesaver during the rushed briefing. We still have a few points to follow up, but you made the explanation much clearer.","Having you clarify the questions was a bit of a lifesaver at short notice, and I will make sure the remaining points get a clear answer later."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1618', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1618-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["傳統風格在這環境仍有用途，可與新設計並存。"],"options":["閱讀室必須棄掉較新書架，才能保留書桌。","句子說傳統傢俬在任何新空間都不可能有用。","書桌只被暫放一個角落，成員完全不能使用。","傳統風格在這環境仍有用途，可與新設計並存。"]},"advanced-native-1618-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["An older style can work alongside newer pieces in this room.","We value what the desk does, not only whether it matches the latest style.","Traditional furniture still has its place when it supports a useful activity.","The desk gives members a practical surface for writing."],"options":["An older style can work alongside newer pieces in this room.","We value what the desk does, not only whether it matches the latest style.","Traditional furniture still has its place when it supports a useful activity.","The desk gives members a practical surface for writing."]},"advanced-native-1618-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Traditional furniture still has its place in this room."],"options":["Traditional furniture still has its place in this room.","A modern renovation means any older-style piece must be removed regardless of its use.","Keeping this piece requires every other item to have the same traditional style."]},"advanced-native-1618-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["每個家庭的每個位置都應改成同一傳統風格。"],"options":["傳統風格仍可能有合適角色。","每個家庭的每個位置都應改成同一傳統風格。","要按空間、用途及使用者需要判斷。"]},"advanced-native-1618-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["Traditional furniture still has its place if it meets a need here; let us assess the desk rather than dismiss the style alone."],"options":["Judge the desk only by whether every other item shares its style.","Traditional furniture still has its place if it meets a need here; let us assess the desk rather than dismiss the style alone.","Remove it before asking how members use it, because the room has newer pieces."]},"advanced-native-1618-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["Traditional furniture still has its place on our stage, where its style helps suggest the older family living room in the story.","For this set, traditional furniture still has its place as part of the visual storytelling, without becoming a rule for every everyday room at school."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1619', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1619-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["椅子連着個人故事，讓她感到家更有溫度。"],"options":["椅子連着個人故事，讓她感到家更有溫度。","只要椅子價錢較高，就能在任何家帶來同樣感受。","Maya 把椅子視為沒有私人故事的標準展示物件。","Maya 重視的只是椅子的轉售價格，與記憶無關。"]},"advanced-native-1619-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["She feels the home’s character is shaped by things with a story.","Their familiar stories can give a home more soul.","They connect everyday meals with memories of her grandmother.","Their value to her includes personal meaning, not only practical seating."],"options":["She feels the home’s character is shaped by things with a story.","Their familiar stories can give a home more soul.","They connect everyday meals with memories of her grandmother.","Their value to her includes personal meaning, not only practical seating."]},"advanced-native-1619-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Shared handmade pieces can give a home more soul."],"options":["Shared handmade pieces can give a home more soul.","The only meaning of the pieces is their price in a shop.","The family keeps the pieces mainly to copy a uniform showroom look, not because of a shared experience."]},"advanced-native-1619-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["只靠物品夠貴，就必定讓每個住戶有相同歸屬感。"],"options":["需交代哪些故事、活動或感受支持這評價。","可讓人覺得地方較有個人意義。","只靠物品夠貴，就必定讓每個住戶有相同歸屬感。"]},"advanced-native-1619-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["Old things may give a home more soul when they connect with your life, but age alone does not supply that connection."],"options":["Choose only by age and leave your own memories or uses out of the decision.","Assume an unfamiliar antique carries the same personal meaning as an object your family has used for years.","Old things may give a home more soul when they connect with your life, but age alone does not supply that connection."]},"advanced-native-1619-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["A weekly evening of songs and stories could give a home more soul. We could take turns sharing one piece of music and the memory behind it.","For our family, making time to listen to each other’s music memories may give a home more soul than adding another decoration."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1620', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1620-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["具體本地物件及故事讓設計與地方過往相連。"],"options":["房間刻意移除地方背景，讓它與任何地方都沒有分別。","設計的唯一價值是同一套可在任何地方複製的展示效果。","具體本地物件及故事讓設計與地方過往相連。","物件外觀已確認來源年代，不需再看敘述或紀錄。"]},"advanced-native-1620-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The design includes specific memories of the area.","It gives visitors reasons to connect the objects with the place.","The details could not simply be copied into any town without losing meaning.","Its local pieces and stories help it feel rooted rather than generic."],"options":["The design includes specific memories of the area.","It gives visitors reasons to connect the objects with the place.","The details could not simply be copied into any town without losing meaning.","Its local pieces and stories help it feel rooted rather than generic."]},"advanced-native-1620-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Those details can help the café feel rooted rather than generic."],"options":["The café’s identity is explained only by a design copied without reference to the place.","Those details can help the café feel rooted rather than generic.","The old-fashioned look is enough to date the displayed pieces, even without source notes."]},"advanced-native-1620-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["帶有地方故事的外觀，就等於年代及來源已核實。"],"options":["有特定地方或歷史連結的感受。","帶有地方故事的外觀，就等於年代及來源已核實。","仍需查核物件年代及故事來源。"]},"advanced-native-1620-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["It may feel rooted rather than generic, but we should check the provenance before making claims about age."],"options":["It may feel rooted rather than generic, but we should check the provenance before making claims about age.","Use the old-fashioned look as the only evidence needed for the object’s age.","Leave the story labels unchecked because an attractive room makes their accuracy less important."]},"advanced-native-1620-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["I want my application to feel rooted rather than generic, so I will explain how helping new pupils find their classrooms taught me to listen.","To help this account feel rooted rather than generic, I will describe the route guide I made and the questions that changed it. Could you check whether the example supports my point?"],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1621', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1621-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["他用機器運轉比喻平常活動，沒有提出競賽目標。"],"options":["日記是在回顧他已取得的比賽成績。","他用機器運轉比喻平常活動，沒有提出競賽目標。","他正以日常習慣描述爭取比賽最高成績的訓練。","他主要在談外觀如何改變，而不是平常活動的目的。"]},"advanced-native-1621-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["By keeping the body ticking over, he meant ordinary continued activity rather than training for competition.","His aim was to maintain an everyday routine, without chasing a personal best.","The machine image expressed basic maintenance, not peak performance.","He was explaining his own aim, not reporting a competition result."],"options":["By keeping the body ticking over, he meant ordinary continued activity rather than training for competition.","His aim was to maintain an everyday routine, without chasing a personal best.","The machine image expressed basic maintenance, not peak performance.","He was explaining his own aim, not reporting a competition result."]},"advanced-native-1621-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["She describes the aim as keeping the body ticking over."],"options":["She is describing a plan to achieve a record-breaking result.","Her personal description gives enough evidence to rank this routine above another person’s.","She describes the aim as keeping the body ticking over."]},"advanced-native-1621-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["已做過效果比較，確定這習慣比另一種更有效。"],"options":["已做過效果比較，確定這習慣比另一種更有效。","需按語境分清平常活動與追求最高表現。","人物用機器圖像形容基本維持。"]},"advanced-native-1621-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["He described keeping the body ticking over, so the summary should reflect ordinary maintenance rather than a record-breaking goal."],"options":["Report the phrase as a measured improvement rather than an account of his personal aim.","He described keeping the body ticking over, so the summary should reflect ordinary maintenance rather than a record-breaking goal.","Keep the competition headline even though he explicitly contrasted his routine with it."]},"advanced-n