('advanced-native-1658', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1658-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["大家趕到下一個地方時，匆匆吃東西並忙其他事。"],"options":["大家在預留一小時的餐桌慢慢吃，之後才查入口。","大家先完成入口核對，之後才停下來吃午餐。","大家已結束導覽，才到車站會合吃晚餐。","大家趕到下一個地方時，匆匆吃東西並忙其他事。"]},"advanced-native-1658-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["There was no settled lunch stop; we fitted the food in between places.","Lunch happened alongside the work of getting the group to the museum.","We ate on the run while moving from the station to the museum.","We finished sandwiches while checking the entrance arrangements."],"options":["There was no settled lunch stop; we fitted the food in between places.","Lunch happened alongside the work of getting the group to the museum.","We ate on the run while moving from the station to the museum.","We finished sandwiches while checking the entrance arrangements."]},"advanced-native-1658-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["She was eating on the run during the busy shift."],"options":["She had a long uninterrupted meal before returning to the list.","Her meal was leisurely simply because she stayed inside the shop.","She was eating on the run during the busy shift."]},"advanced-native-1658-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["留一段不趕急時間，坐下專心與朋友慢慢用餐。"],"options":["留一段不趕急時間，坐下專心與朋友慢慢用餐。","繁忙工作間隙，只能抽空吃幾口。","趕下個會議途中，一邊確認時間一邊吃三文治。"]},"advanced-native-1658-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["Yes, it describes eating in a hurry while busy; it does not require literal running."],"options":["Yes, it describes eating in a hurry while busy; it does not require literal running.","No, remaining inside the shop means the meal must count as leisurely.","It simply means getting a takeaway rather than cooking at home, even if the meal is unhurried."]},"advanced-native-1658-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["I have been eating on the run all week, so could we leave an hour for a proper lunch and a conversation this time? I would still love to see you.","Rather than eat on the run between another two ac