('advanced-native-1661', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1661-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["不顯眼的重複安排支撐日常工作。"],"options":["那些小安排只在整周工作結束後才首次出現。","不顯眼的重複安排支撐日常工作。","教學周主要靠一次大型整理，之後不再有日常動作。","支持教學周的主要因素是換了新課本，而非那些日常小安排。"]},"advanced-native-1661-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The quiet architecture of everyday habits supported the week, especially preparing folders and noting questions.","I used small repeatable actions rather than rely on remembering everything at once.","The ordinary routines made space for the next class and its questions.","Preparing before leaving and making a short note afterwards gave the week a useful structure."],"options":["The quiet architecture of everyday habits supported the week, especially preparing folders and noting questions.","I used small repeatable actions rather than rely on remembering everything at once.","The ordinary routines made space for the next class and its questions.","Preparing before leaving and making a short note afterwards gave the week a useful structure."]},"advanced-native-1661-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Her mornings were supported by the quiet architecture of everyday habits."],"options":["The arrangements were mainly a one-off display for visitors, not something she relied on each morning.","Her mornings were supported by the quiet architecture of everyday habits.","The author describes a single morning when she rearranged the whole house."]},"advanced-native-1661-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["不顯眼的小動作累積成可依靠的生活架構。"],"options":["一次重大宣布本身已等於可持續的反覆習慣。","不顯眼的小動作累積成可依靠的生活架構。","只描述總共工作多少小時，而不涉及反覆行動怎樣支撐日常。"]},"advanced-native-1661-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["The image comes from the repeated actions that support her mornings, not a single large clear-out."],"options":["The image comes from the repeated actions that support her mornings, not a single large clear-out.","The weekend clear-out is the main event, and the nightly actions have no part in the image.","The image concerns how much time she worked, rather than the structure of her routine."]},"advanced-native-1661-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["I appreciate the quiet architecture of everyday habits in this ensemble, from tuning together to leaving notes for the next rehearsal. Could you show me how to contribute to those routines?","The quiet architecture of everyday habits helps a new member like me find a place in the ensemble. Thank you for the repeated care; I would like to learn how to help with the rehearsal notes."],"options":[]}}'::jsonb),
('advanced-native-1663', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-1663-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["長期負荷後，她持續疲憊並失去原有投入感。"],"options":["她只在一場活動後累片刻，翌日已完全如常。","她因得到更有趣的新角色而主動轉職。","她仍非常享受每晚工作，問題只是一次訊息延遲。","長期負荷後，她持續疲憊並失去原有投入感。"]},"advanced-native-1663-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["She had lost the enjoyment she used to find in organising the club.","The repeated workload was affecting her ability to engage with the next task.","She began to burn out after carrying every evening shift for months.","The work left her drained even before she opened the next planning message."],"options":["She had lost the enjoyment she used to find in organising the club.","The repeated workload was affecting her ability to engage with the next task.","She began to burn out after carrying every evening shift for months.","The work left her drained even before she opened the next planning message."]},"advanced-native-1663-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["The character seems to be burning out after the prolonged workload."],"options":["The character has found a new enthusiasm for taking on more projects.","The character seems to be burning out after the prolonged workload.","The passage describes only a brief burst of tiredness during one otherwise enjoyable evening."]},"advanced-native-1663-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["一場愉快遊戲後暫時有點累，片刻後又想繼續。"],"options":["長期負荷後，持續感到耗竭並失去以往投入感。","一場愉快遊戲後暫時有點累，片刻後又想繼續。","接連數月工作後，未開始新任務已覺耗盡。"]},"advanced-native-1663-v1-branch":{"type":"mc","answers":["The story describes a longer pattern of burning out, not just a reaction to tonight’s message."],"options":["The story describes a longer pattern of burning out, not just a reaction to tonight’s message.","We can explain the whole passage by the wording of this one message alone.","Her main reason is probably a new role with more interesting tasks, rather than exhaustion from the old duties."]},"advanced-native-1663-v1-final":{"type":"open","answers":["I worry that you may be burning out afte